{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_6814D1CA","title":"Pilk demands your help","entry":"Dlg_6814D1CA::entry","exit":"Dlg_6814D1CA::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_AA6D8F95","articyId":"72057783016490367","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Pilk Dane","text":"You. What took you so long?","speakerId":"Ntt_804BFB66","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You. What took you so long?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":525.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"51807","byteOffset":34015536,"byteLength":336}},{"id":"DFr_A70351C1","articyId":"72057783016490377","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Pilk Dane","text":"No, I TRIED to change the locks. You seem to have some sort of advanced Automata that stopped me, and I do not understand why.","speakerId":"Ntt_804BFB66","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"No, I TRIED to change the locks. You seem to have some sort of advanced Automata that stopped me, and I do not understand why.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":1125.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"45749","byteOffset":31639432,"byteLength":472}},{"id":"DFr_14B6ADCC","articyId":"72057783016490392","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Pilk Dane","text":"You don't need to know all the details. Just the targets.","speakerId":"Ntt_804BFB66","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You don't need to know all the details. Just the targets.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":2325.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"51898","byteOffset":34049432,"byteLength":404}},{"id":"DFr_7E812A45","articyId":"72057783016490402","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Pilk Dane","text":"Look, I know you've been skulking around at night. I need those skulking skills.","speakerId":"Ntt_804BFB66","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Look, I know you've been skulking around at night. I need those skulking skills.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":2925.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"17892","byteOffset":14657568,"byteLength":496}},{"id":"DFr_490B27A6","articyId":"72057774426570432","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Pilk Dane","text":"Do a good job and you can stay. And I'll even throw some Lims your way. You won't get a better deal than that.","speakerId":"Ntt_804BFB66","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Do a good job and you can stay. And I'll even throw some Lims your way. You won't get a better deal than that.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":4125.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"19193","byteOffset":15145544,"byteLength":420}},{"id":"DFr_C55AFAAC","articyId":"72057774426570460","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Pilk Dane","text":"Turn them over. Wreck 'em. Sneak in and make a mess. It's that simple.","speakerId":"Ntt_804BFB66","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Turn them over. Wreck 'em. Sneak in and make a mess. It's that simple.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":4725.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"37656","byteOffset":28584168,"byteLength":416}},{"id":"DFr_8AD430E9","articyId":"72057821671320775","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Pilk Dane","text":"Do you plan to be homeless soon?","speakerId":"Ntt_804BFB66","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Do you plan to be homeless soon?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":2325.0,"y":625.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"38342","byteOffset":28840480,"byteLength":340}},{"id":"DFr_B9C2F683","articyId":"72057606922887463","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Pilk Dane","text":"I don't know what you're talking about. I know how tenants behave, they don't move a muscle if I don't send a clear message.","speakerId":"Ntt_804BFB66","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I don't know what you're talking about. I know how tenants behave, they don't move a muscle if I don't send a clear message.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":2325.0,"y":900.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"43834","byteOffset":30914400,"byteLength":432}},{"id":"DFr_953C3D89","articyId":"72057783016490372","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"You changed the locks on my apartment.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You changed the locks on my apartment.","TextSheVersion":"You changed the locks on my apartment.","TextTheyVersion":"You changed the locks on my apartment."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":825.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"39041","byteOffset":29101992,"byteLength":320}},{"id":"DFr_460CA952","articyId":"72057783016490382","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"What's the deal?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"What's the deal?","TextSheVersion":"What's the deal?","TextTheyVersion":"What's the deal?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1425.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"39357","byteOffset":29219848,"byteLength":296}},{"id":"DFr_181E29D4","articyId":"72057783016490387","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Pilk Dane","text":"I need you to do a job for me.","speakerId":"Ntt_804BFB66","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I need you to do a job for me.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1725.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"40915","byteOffset":29805848,"byteLength":384}},{"id":"DFr_A437E91E","articyId":"72057783016490397","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Targets?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Targets?","TextSheVersion":"Targets?","TextTheyVersion":"Targets?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2625.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"51596","byteOffset":33936016,"byteLength":288}},{"id":"DFr_1DD535E6","articyId":"72057783016490407","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"You've been spying on me?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You've been spying on me?","TextSheVersion":"You've been spying on me?","TextTheyVersion":"You've been spying on me?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3225.0,"y":200.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"47304","byteOffset":32232184,"byteLength":308}},{"id":"DFr_E824A709","articyId":"72057783016490412","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Pilk Dane","text":"Look, either you do this job or I find a way to change those locks. If needs be, I'll have you evicted.","speakerId":"Ntt_804BFB66","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Look, either you do this job or I find a way to change those locks. If needs be, I'll have you evicted.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3525.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"33699","byteOffset":20633280,"byteLength":384}},{"id":"DFr_04E19060","articyId":"72057783016490417","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"What's the job?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"What's the job?","TextSheVersion":"What's the job?","TextTheyVersion":"What's the job?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2025.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"31272","byteOffset":19710080,"byteLength":296}},{"id":"DFr_E77F31AF","articyId":"72057783016490422","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Ava","text":"We may need to help him. Tenants have little recourse to eviction in Nivalis. The law is on his side.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"We may need to help him. Tenants have little recourse to eviction in Nivalis. The law is on his side.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3825.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"37185","byteOffset":28408896,"byteLength":384}},{"id":"DFr_86A13801","articyId":"72057783016492635","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"If you want me to skulk for you it will cost you.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"If you want me to skulk for you it will cost you.","TextSheVersion":"If you want me to skulk for you it will cost you.","TextTheyVersion":"If you want me to skulk for you it will cost you."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3225.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"28662","byteOffset":18727328,"byteLength":356}},{"id":"DFr_EA8C9B0F","articyId":"72057783016492642","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Skulk yourself.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Skulk yourself.","TextSheVersion":"Skulk yourself.","TextTheyVersion":"Skulk yourself."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3225.0,"y":650.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"22631","byteOffset":16448096,"byteLength":296}},{"id":"DFr_3A288A51","articyId":"72057774426570438","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"What do I do with these \"targets?\"","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"What do I do with these \"targets?\"","TextSheVersion":"What do I do with these \"targets?\"","TextTheyVersion":"What do I do with these \"targets?\""},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":4425.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"16521","byteOffset":14146576,"byteLength":316}},{"id":"DFr_B72098B4","articyId":"72057774426570466","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"I'm not sure about this.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I'm not sure about this.","TextSheVersion":"I'm not sure about this.","TextTheyVersion":"I'm not sure about this."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":5025.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"31194","byteOffset":19681408,"byteLength":304}},{"id":"DFr_4C370844","articyId":"72057774426570474","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"I'll do it for the money.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I'll do it for the money.","TextSheVersion":"I'll do it for the money.","TextTheyVersion":"I'll do it for the money."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":5025.0,"y":550.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"44549","byteOffset":31183456,"byteLength":308}},{"id":"DFr_8B9E49A2","articyId":"72057774426570481","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Pilk Dane","text":"GET sure. And get out of here. I have real work to do.","speakerId":"Ntt_804BFB66","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"GET sure. And get out of here. I have real work to do.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":5325.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"19699","byteOffset":15335808,"byteLength":336}},{"id":"DFr_F8554B4C","articyId":"72057774426570488","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Pilk Dane","text":"I can respect an entrepreneurial spirit. Now get on with it.","speakerId":"Ntt_804BFB66","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I can respect an entrepreneurial spirit. Now get on with it.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":5325.0,"y":550.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"20360","byteOffset":15586136,"byteLength":340}},{"id":"DFr_FC7C8E13","articyId":"72057774426570497","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Ava","text":"I have a suggestion. A way to get out of this, though it may get you in trouble. And it likely won't make you any money.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I have a suggestion. A way to get out of this, though it may get you in trouble. And it likely won't make you any money.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":5625.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"49118","byteOffset":32923072,"byteLength":400}},{"id":"DFr_2547233F","articyId":"72057774426570505","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Go on.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Go on.","TextSheVersion":"Go on.","TextTheyVersion":"Go on."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":5925.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"35832","byteOffset":27902904,"byteLength":288}},{"id":"DFr_16BEEBC5","articyId":"72057774426570512","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Ava","text":"We trash one of Pilk's properties instead. Then I send a message saying it was done by his business rivals.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"We trash one of Pilk's properties instead. Then I send a message saying it was done by his business rivals.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":6225.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"42053","byteOffset":30235760,"byteLength":388}},{"id":"DFr_70DEC269","articyId":"72057774426570518","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Won't he find out?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Won't he find out?","TextSheVersion":"Won't he find out?","TextTheyVersion":"Won't he find out?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":6525.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"42764","byteOffset":30508200,"byteLength":300}},{"id":"DFr_E6A33374","articyId":"72057774426570526","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Ava","text":"I don't think so. His Comm is old and easy to hack. I'll send a message that looks like it came from his rivals. That should teach him a lesson about trashing other people's properties.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I don't think so. His Comm is old and easy to hack. I'll send a message that looks like it came from his rivals. That should teach him a lesson about trashing other people's properties.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":6825.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"20220","byteOffset":15534920,"byteLength":504}},{"id":"DFr_D6AF3770","articyId":"72057774426570532","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"I'll think about it.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I'll think about it.","TextSheVersion":"I'll think about it.","TextTheyVersion":"I'll think about it."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":7125.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"44564","byteOffset":31189448,"byteLength":300}},{"id":"DFr_981AEAFF","articyId":"72057606922849135","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"I don't know what you're talking about.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I don't know what you're talking about.","TextSheVersion":"I don't know what you're talking about.","TextTheyVersion":"I don't know what you're talking about."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3225.0,"y":875.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"25938","byteOffset":17694760,"byteLength":320}},{"id":"DFr_7C2C35FB","articyId":"72057821671320759","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Why are you annoying me?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"